message: "If you use this analysis or its derived data, please cite it as below."
title: "Hospital-Acquired Pressure Injury: What the Federal Data Shows"
abstract: >-
  Analysis of CMS-published pressure injury rates (PSI-03) across 3,056 US
  acute care hospitals, combined with Hospital-Acquired Condition Reduction
  Program penalty data for FY2026. Finds that 178 hospitals are rated worse
  than the national pressure ulcer rate while only 49 are rated better, and
  that 95 hospitals are both penalized under HACRP and rated worse on PSI-03.
